# Copying a Flagged entry and pasting it in the outline adds a copy with its tags, which the Flagged view then lists too.
file <<END
Shop:
	- Milk @flag(urgent) @blue
Done list:
	- Eggs
END
keys gF y gh G p gF
see - Milk 󰈻  Done list
quit
saved <<END
Shop:
	- Milk @flag(urgent) @blue
Done list:
	- Eggs
	- Milk @flag(urgent) @blue
END
